Package: maplibr
Title: R Interface to the 'maplib' Knowledge Graph Engine
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Novica", "Nakov", , "nnovica@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-7773-7718")))
Description: Build, query, and reason over RDF knowledge graphs backed by the
    'maplib' Rust engine. Graphs are constructed from tabular data using OTTR
    mapping templates, queried with SPARQL, and returned as ordinary R
    data frames via the Arrow C Stream Interface. Also supports RDFS
    inference and reading/writing common RDF serializations (Turtle,
    N-Triples, RDF/XML).
License: Apache License (>= 2.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
